{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_15107100","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15107100","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1510709001:":{"text":"형!","source_cn":"哥哥！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF92AECAA62274ED2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1510709002:":{"text":"형, 왜 아직도 안 간 거야!","source_cn":"哥哥，你怎么还没走呀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB599CF8657A16831","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1510709003:":{"text":"나, 난...","source_cn":"我、我……<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9AE1C156FA83E0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1510710001:0":{"text":"형, 지휘관님의 부대는 북쪽으로 갔어. 형은 안 따라가도 되는 거야?","source_cn":"哥哥，统帅大人从城北走了，你不跟上他的队伍吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D969356CDCB727C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1510710002:0":{"text":"...휴, 넌 몰라. 나도 무서운 게 있다고...","source_cn":"……唉，你不懂，哥哥也有害怕的事……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF69E321FF76D6E3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1510710003:0":{"text":"형... 혹시 겁이 나는 거야? 나도 베이티의 아버지가 출정 후에 돌아오지 못했다는 이야기를 듣긴 했는데...","source_cn":"你……你是害怕吗？我听说贝迪说，他父亲出征后就再也没回来……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x206D722B01C24AAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1510710004:0":{"text":"주니, 잘 들어. 지휘관님이 이끌고 간 부대는... 위험한 길을 지나야 할 거야.","source_cn":"朱尼，你仔细听我说，统帅这支队伍……路线比较危险。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DEF2D5D6D342681","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1510710005:0":{"text":"위험하다고...? 얼마나 위험한데?","source_cn":"危险……有多危险？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1ED9001BD9C0D936","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1510710006:0":{"text":"만약... 만약 형이 다시 못 돌아오면...","source_cn":"要是……要是去了就再也回不来的话……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63D86D69486025A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1510710007:0":{"text":"괜찮을 거야... 넌 아직 어리니까 그런 걱정은 안 해도 돼.","source_cn":"不会的……小小年纪，别担心那么多。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF35D87CCCE807951","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1510710008:0":{"text":"주니, 형은 이제 가봐야 해... 건강 잘 챙기고, 알겠지?","source_cn":"朱尼，哥哥该走了。你……你要好好照顾自己，知道吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EEA4EA4E8EFBC8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1510710009:0":{"text":"형...","source_cn":"哥哥……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25BC38C3901D0694","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1510710010:0":{"text":"저 겁쟁이가 페르세우스의 부대에 합류할 모양입니다.","source_cn":"那个懦夫要去追珀尔修斯的队伍。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x062C13B6B17D5348","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1510710011:0":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">저 자를 따라가면</style>, 페르세우스가 움직이는 경로와 목적을 알아낼 수 있을 겁니다.","source_cn":"<style=highlight>跟着他</style...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCBDED8EEEA5B292F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1510710012:0":{"text":"로르 부관이 이끄는 주요 부대도 그냥 둘 순 없는데...","source_cn":"隆尔副将带领的主力军队也不能放着不管……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4EE1391356171A39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1510710013:0":{"text":"흩어져서 움직일까?","source_cn":"分头行动？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3DD846CD9324A9D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":